// HTH Guide Excerpt: begin review-plugins-and-hooks
// Enterprise-level MANAGED MANIFEST, not system.json or user config.json.
// Paste only after inventorying business-critical plugins and their dependencies.
// Empty allowlists below mean no optional plugins: a deliberate lockdown template.
// Add reviewed pinned sources to optionalPlugins/requiredPlugins as appropriate.
// Managed-manifest fetch failures currently fail open; this is NOT an offline boundary.
{
  "requiredPlugins": [],
  "optionalPlugins": [],
  "forbiddenPlugins": ["*"]
}
// HTH Guide Excerpt: end review-plugins-and-hooks
